* START-HISTORY:
* 18 Oct 26 Windows port - from Linux ab4dab3 (13 Oct 26): BY / BY.DSND field {NO.CASE} sorts the pick list (it is passed to SELECT,
*               list 11); Return pages forward in a record; Esc-Z pages back (openQM page).
* 18 Oct 26 Windows port - from Linux 37b0630 (12 Oct 26): X deletes the item being shown, after asking; one taken from the
*               pick list is taken off it (openQM 450).
